Package: regcore
Title: Base Utilities and S3 Methods for Regression Models 
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ricardo Rasmussen", "Petterle", , "ricardopetterle@ufpr.br", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7735-1077"))
Description: Provides core generic S3 functions (such as goodness-of-fit tables, 
    equation extraction, and diagnostic plots) to support and unify a family of 
    statistical modeling packages ('unitregTMB', 'unitGEE', 'ashgTMB', 'betamodal', etc.).
